    "faq": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "q1": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "How is Sous different from an electric frother?",
            "a": "<p>A frother spins a whisk head through the liquid on a shaft. Sous turns a disc magnetically from beneath a sealed stainless cup, so the vortex mixes from the bottom up, at a calibrated speed, for a set time.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Do I need to sift my matcha?",
            "a": "<p>Sifting always helps, because it breaks the clumps that pressing forms in the tin. Sous suspends the powder either way; sifted matcha simply finishes smoother.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Can I use any matcha?",
            "a": "<p>Yes. Ceremonial or culinary, any origin. Fill water to an etched 40, 80 or 120 ml guide.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Can it make hot and iced matcha?",
            "a": "<p>Both. Whisk with a little water first, since the upper speeds build a rich concentrate, then pour over hot milk or ice.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "How long does one cycle take?",
            "a": "<p>About thirty seconds. The timer ends it for you.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q6": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "How do I clean it?",
            "a": "<p>Rinse the stainless cup and wipe the base with a damp cloth. Do not submerge the base.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q7": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "What comes with Matcha Sous?",
            "a": "<p>The mixer base, the stainless matcha cup, a power adapter, a USB-C cable and the user manual, in the presentation case.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q8": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "What is the warranty?",
            "a": "<p>One year against manufacturing defects in materials and workmanship. We do not take returns for change of mind, so cancel before your unit ships if you are unsure.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q9": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Can I still use a bamboo chasen?",
            "a": "<p>Of course. Many owners do, on the mornings that allow for it. Sous is there for the ones that don't.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
